{
  "title": "Zesty Earthy Irish Tomato Stew",
  "description": "A hearty and earthy stew featuring tomato juice, perfect for a brunch mood, and friendly to Buddhist temple dietary preferences. This dish is pressure-cooked to create a rich and gooey texture.",
  "cuisine": "Irish",
